      "text": [
        "239 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «بِئْسَ اَلْبَيْتُ اَلْحَمَّامُ يَهْتِكُ اَلسِّتْرَ وَ يُبْدِي اَلْعَوْرَةَ وَ نِعْمَ اَلْبَيْتُ اَلْحَمَّامُ يُذَكِّرُ حَرَّ اَلنَّارِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.239 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n'The bathhouse is an undesirable place; it removes coverings (privacy) and exposes the private parts. However, it is a good place as it reminds one of the heats of the Fire (Hellfire).'."
        ]
      }
